      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "馬車が動かなくなってしもうてな……\n壊れた車軸はメガエラの職人にしか作れん。\n坊や、ついでがあれば買ってきてくれんか…？\n特別に、乗合馬車を使えるようにしてやるぞ！",
        "official_en": "Ahh, my carriage is ruined! Only the craftsmen in\nMegaira will have the axle I need to get it going\nagain. Hey, boy, could you buy one for me? As a\nthank-you, I'll give you access to using <#CTRL:0E><#CTRL:08>",
